{"4667210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Fapper", "steam_appid": 4667210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/53b6527feb9665f3d572129215e81fde.avif?t=1788183079\" width=373 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack has spent his entire life isolated in the wilderness, surviving as a lumberjack beside his father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then his father leaves to trade and never returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/150e36ef485464432530dec9ff3cec58.poster.avif?t=1788183079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/150e36ef485464432530dec9ff3cec58.webm?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/150e36ef485464432530dec9ff3cec58.mp4?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden box beneath the cabin floor gives Jack his first clue. To find the truth, he must leave the forest and enter civilization for the first time. What begins as a personal search soon pulls him toward a royal deception threatening the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TLF is a single-player, third-person medieval action RPG about survival, desire, relationships, and consequence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/bffca554e42c67fe49bf794f65058e14.poster.avif?t=1788183079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/bffca554e42c67fe49bf794f65058e14.webm?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/bffca554e42c67fe49bf794f65058e14.mp4?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous regions, fight through responsive melee combat, meet people with their own needs and daily routines, and decide who you can trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world remembers how you treat people. Your choices can change access, alliances, hostility, future events, and the way entire communities respond to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relationships are not side content in TLF. They are progression.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/aa3a43106426006425c26697ca56c286.poster.avif?t=1788183079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/aa3a43106426006425c26697ca56c286.webm?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/aa3a43106426006425c26697ca56c286.mp4?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship, rivalry, trust, and romance can unlock information, support, opportunities, story paths, and new powers through Divine Favor. Building a bond takes more than choosing the right dialogue option. You need to understand people, act consistently, and live with the consequences of what you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person medieval melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with needs, schedules, and memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationship progression built around trust, friendship, rivalry, and romance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that reshape quests, alliances, routines, and future events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, combat, work, and dialogue connected through one continuous experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mature medieval story where social intelligence can matter as much as skill with a weapon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Connect. Rise.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/53b6527feb9665f3d572129215e81fde.avif?t=1788183079\" width=373 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack has spent his entire life isolated in the wilderness, surviving as a lumberjack beside his father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then his father leaves to trade and never returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/150e36ef485464432530dec9ff3cec58.poster.avif?t=1788183079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/150e36ef485464432530dec9ff3cec58.webm?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/150e36ef485464432530dec9ff3cec58.mp4?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden box beneath the cabin floor gives Jack his first clue. To find the truth, he must leave the forest and enter civilization for the first time. What begins as a personal search soon pulls him toward a royal deception threatening the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TLF is a single-player, third-person medieval action RPG about survival, desire, relationships, and consequence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/bffca554e42c67fe49bf794f65058e14.poster.avif?t=1788183079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/bffca554e42c67fe49bf794f65058e14.webm?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/bffca554e42c67fe49bf794f65058e14.mp4?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous regions, fight through responsive melee combat, meet people with their own needs and daily routines, and decide who you can trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world remembers how you treat people. Your choices can change access, alliances, hostility, future events, and the way entire communities respond to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relationships are not side content in TLF. They are progression.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/aa3a43106426006425c26697ca56c286.poster.avif?t=1788183079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/aa3a43106426006425c26697ca56c286.webm?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667210/extras/aa3a43106426006425c26697ca56c286.mp4?t=1788183079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship, rivalry, trust, and romance can unlock information, support, opportunities, story paths, and new powers through Divine Favor. Building a bond takes more than choosing the right dialogue option. You need to understand people, act consistently, and live with the consequences of what you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person medieval melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with needs, schedules, and memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationship progression built around trust, friendship, rivalry, and romance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that reshape quests, alliances, routines, and future events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, combat, work, and dialogue connected through one continuous experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mature med